# A long leg with a failure injected while it is in progress. The vehicle's
# failsafe returns to launch; the program's leg cannot finish, and the bridge
# reports E_SAFETY_VIOLATION instead of pretending the leg completed.
needs: drone, log

action main():
    log "phase 15 failsafe leg"
    arm drone
    takeoff to 20 meters
    fly to vector(47.6020, 8.5020, 20) at 20 meters
    return to launch
